# Bamep Issue #71 — WinPE UEFI-PXE host-proof fixture manifest.
#
# These files are NOT in the repository (third-party / Microsoft-restricted
# binaries — same policy as integration/physical/issue-53-winpe-secure-boot).
# Stage them yourself into $BAMEP_BVE_WINPE_FIXTURE_ROOT, then:
#
#   cd "$BAMEP_BVE_WINPE_FIXTURE_ROOT" && sha256sum -c /path/to/scripts/winpe-pxe-fixture.sha256
#
# Provenance and how to obtain each file: scripts/winpe-pxe-fixture.provenance.md
# Boot Adapter mechanism decision: docs/decisions/0021-ipxe-wimboot-network-delivered-winpe-baseline.md
#
# Format is `sha256sum -c` compatible: <sha256>␠␠<name>
#
# The exact hashes below are empirical evidence (matching the Issue #53 physical
# chain), NOT permanent version pins — a boot-artifact update needs
# requalification per ADR-0021.

